cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  To cite the mathematics, cite the paper (preferred citation below). To cite
  the formalization itself, cite this repository.
title: "Invariance principles for Galton–Watson trees conditioned on the number of leaves: Lean formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kortchemski
    given-names: Igor
repository-code: https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/invariance-principles-galton-watson-leaves
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - Galton–Watson trees
  - invariance principles
  - stable Lévy processes
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of every numbered result of "Invariance
  principles for Galton–Watson trees conditioned on the number of leaves" by
  Igor Kortchemski, Theorems 1.10 and 8.1(I) in corrected form, using only the
  axioms propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. Produced with AI agents; the
  Lean kernel checks the proofs.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Invariance principles for Galton–Watson trees conditioned on the number of leaves
  authors:
    - family-names: Kortchemski
      given-names: Igor
  journal: Stochastic Processes and their Applications
  volume: 122
  year: 2012
  start: 3126
  end: 3172
  doi: 10.1016/j.spa.2012.05.013
  url: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.spa.2012.05.013
